    "result_text": "The build is green.\n\nI implemented the customerCode de-duplication in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:\n\n- `buildCustomerCode` now composes the base code (`<REGION>-<HASH8>`) as before, then passes it through a new `deduplicateCustomerCode` helper.\n- `deduplicateCustomerCode` collects all existing owners' customer codes into a `Set`. If the base code is unused, it's returned unchanged; otherwise it appends `-<n>`, incrementing `n` from `2` upward until it finds a code no existing owner holds, and returns that.\n\nThis runs before `saveOwner`, matching the existing pattern of the surrounding derivation helpers. `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
